        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "# Example Developer Workspace"
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "This is a small fictional project for ContextSutra demonstration. It has an API layer and a web app."
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "## Architecture"
        },
        {
          "line": 6,
          "text": "- `src/api.js` serves API endpoints in an imaginary application."
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "- Docs under `docs/adr/` are examples of versioned technical decisions."
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "text": "## Conventions"
        },
        {
          "line": 10,
          "text": "- Add tests for changes in public API behavior."
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "- Use minimal dependencies and prefer deterministic data transformations."
        }
      ],
